# Cloudflare Pages redirects — Lovett Counseling & Consulting
#
# www → non-www. Both hostnames were serving the whole site with a 200 and no
# redirect between them, so Google saw two complete copies. Every canonical tag
# and every sitemap entry says non-www, so that is the address that wins.
#
# The trailing "!" forces the rule to take precedence over a matching static
# file, which is what makes it actually fire on Cloudflare Pages — the same
# pattern that works on crescitacounseling.com.
#
# Do NOT add rules like "/about -> /about.html". Cloudflare Pages serves clean
# URLs natively and 308-redirects /about.html -> /about; pointing it back the
# other way creates an infinite loop.

https://www.lovettcounselingandconsulting.com/*  https://lovettcounselingandconsulting.com/:splat  301!
